    E --> F[Kinetochore Assembly]
    F --> G[Microtubule Capture]
    G --> H[Metaphase Alignment]
    H --> I[Spindle Assembly Checkpoint]
    I --> J{All Chromosomes Aligned?}
    J -->|No| K[Anaphase Delay]
    K --> L[Kinetochore-Microtubule Correction]
    L --> H
    
    J -->|Yes| M[Anaphase Promoting Complex]
    M --> N[Securin Degradation]
    N --> O[Separase Activation]
    O --> P[Cohesin Cleavage]
    P --> Q[Anaphase A]
    Q --> R[Chromosome Segregation]
